class.description:
AudioStream implementation that uses libopenmpt to play tracker music files. Tracker music was popular in retro games and the demoscene, storing patterns of notes and samples instead of raw audio data. Supports 50+ tracker formats including MOD (Amiga ProTracker), XM (FastTracker II), S3M (ScreamTracker 3), IT (Impulse Tracker), and many more. [codeblock] var stream = AudioStreamOpenMPT.new() stream.load_from_file("res://music/song.mod")
var player = AudioStreamPlayer.new() add_child(player) player.stream = stream player.play()
# Get playback control (must be playing first) var playback = player.get_stream_playback() as AudioStreamPlaybackOpenMPT playback.set_tempo_factor(1.5) # Speed up [/codeblock]

method.description:
Loads a tracker music file from the given path. Returns [constant OK] on success, or an error code on failure.
Supported formats: MOD, XM, S3M, IT, MPTM, and 40+ other tracker formats.
[codeblock]
var stream = AudioStreamOpenMPT.new()
var error = stream.load_from_file("res://music/song.mod")
if error != OK:
	push_error("Failed to load module")
[/codeblock]
